        "text": {
            "description_html": "<p><b>Hamilton EN-1803D, 18 Inch S-Grip Dummy Handleset</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handsome square handleset is made of solid bronze. With such a beautiful bronze patina finish, it will add an elegance to any home. Measuring 18\" long, this dummy handleset does not latch or lock. It is most often used as a pull or to match trim on double doors. Available with your choice of inside lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: matching <a href=\"/products/s-grip-18-inch-single-cylinder-mortise-handleset-hamilton-en-1803\"><b>18 Inch Single Cylinder Mortise Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Dummy Hamilton Sinkler EN-1803D Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made with traditional high end high quality craftsmanship.</li>\r\n<li>Made of authentic solid bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Package includes all necessary screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Decorative 18 Inch Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Bronze Patina</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 18\"</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 6-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDummy handlesets are for looks only. They do not lock and do not latch. They are used as a pull or to match trim on the inactive side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This is  discontinued.</b> \r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
